<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-9475] Closures that has been created on client does not provide real class name to TASK_* permissions</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-9475</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Broadcast job for example get org.apache.ignite.internal.processors.closure.GridClosureProcessor$T6 task name.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This combination of java + xml config&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
ignite.compute(ignite.cluster().forServers()).broadcast(&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;new&lt;/span&gt; DistributedJob(cacheName));
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
                                                       {
                                                           task:&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&apos;org.apache.ignite.piclient.operations.DistributedChecksumOperation$DistributedJob&apos;&lt;/span&gt;,
                                                           permissions:[TASK_EXECUTE]
                                                       },
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;provides following error&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
Authorization failed [perm=TASK_EXECUTE, name=org.apache.ignite.internal.processors.closure.GridClosureProcessor$T6, ... ]
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
